WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:04.310
<c.caption-en>Introduction. Our Eco-Budget mission.</c>
<c.caption-zh>课程介绍：我们的 Eco-Budget 任务。</c>

00:00:04.325 --> 00:00:10.765
<c.caption-en>Hey there, Year 7. Today you're going to plan a class celebration.</c>
<c.caption-zh>七年级的同学们，大家好。今天你们要为班级庆祝活动做计划。</c>

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:15.205
<c.caption-en>You can choose a games session, a quiz celebration, or a recycled-art workshop.</c>
<c.caption-zh>你们可以选择游戏活动、知识问答，或再生材料艺术工作坊。</c>

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.325
<c.caption-en>Which one would you choose? We have a pretend budget</c>
<c.caption-zh>你会选哪一种？我们的模拟预算是</c>

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:22.985
<c.caption-en>of 120 ringgit. We're not spending real money today.</c>
<c.caption-zh>120 令吉。今天我们不会真的花钱。</c>

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.460
<c.caption-en>However, you will be learning how to organise your plan using a spreadsheet, like last year.</c>
<c.caption-zh>不过，你们会像去年一样，学习用电子表格整理计划。</c>

00:00:28.475 --> 00:00:35.405
<c.caption-en>I've already prepared this starter table for you, so you won't need to create one from scratch.</c>
<c.caption-zh>我已经准备好起始表格，所以你们不需要从零开始制作。</c>

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:40.485
<c.caption-en>Your job today is to find the correct cells, make four changes,</c>
<c.caption-zh>今天的任务是找到正确的单元格，进行四项修改，</c>

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.855
<c.caption-en>and save your own copy. Our WAGBA is:</c>
<c.caption-zh>然后保存自己的副本。我们的 WAGBA 学习目标是：</c>

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:49.615
<c.caption-en>identify and edit information in a spreadsheet, choose a class activity,</c>
<c.caption-zh>识别和编辑电子表格中的信息，选择一项班级活动，</c>

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:54.415
<c.caption-en>and save my own Eco-Budget starter in school storage.</c>
<c.caption-zh>并将自己的 Eco-Budget 起始工作簿保存在学校存储空间。</c>

00:00:54.430 --> 00:01:01.825
<c.caption-en>Let's break that down so you know what you're learning. First, our knowledge. These are the facts I want you to remember.</c>
<c.caption-zh>我们把目标分开看，弄清楚要学什么。首先是知识：这些是你需要记住的事实。</c>

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.575
<c.caption-en>A spreadsheet contains boxes called cells. Columns go down and use letters.</c>
<c.caption-zh>电子表格中的小方格叫作单元格。列是从上往下的，用字母表示。</c>

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:10.095
<c.caption-en>Rows go across and use numbers.</c>
<c.caption-zh>行是横向的，用数字表示。</c>

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:15.425
<c.caption-en>When we name a cell, we say the column letter first, followed by the row number.</c>
<c.caption-zh>说出单元格地址时，先说列的字母，再说行的数字。</c>

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:21.895
<c.caption-en>For example, B2 means column B, row 2. Next, our skills.</c>
<c.caption-zh>例如，B2 表示 B 列、第 2 行。接下来是技能。</c>

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:29.515
<c.caption-en>These are the things you practise doing. You'll select a cell, replace its content and confirm your change.</c>
<c.caption-zh>技能是你要练习的操作。你要选中单元格、替换内容，并确认修改。</c>

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:35.195
<c.caption-en>Then you'll save your workbook and reopen it to check that your changes are still there.</c>
<c.caption-zh>然后保存工作簿并重新打开，检查修改是否还在。</c>

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:40.545
<c.caption-en>Finally, our understanding. This is where I want you to think about why those actions matter.</c>
<c.caption-zh>最后是理解：想一想，为什么这些操作很重要。</c>

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:48.045
<c.caption-en>Imagine putting the right number beside the wrong item. Your number might be correct, but your plan would tell us the wrong thing.</c>
<c.caption-zh>想象一下，把正确的数字放在错误的物品旁边。数字虽然对，计划表达的信息却错了。</c>

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:54.020
<c.caption-en>And imagine finishing your work, but not knowing where you saved it.</c>
<c.caption-zh>再想一想，完成了作业，却不知道保存在哪里。</c>

00:01:54.035 --> 00:02:00.035
<c.caption-en>We need to check that we can find our workbook again. That's why we'll check both the cell address and the save location.</c>
<c.caption-zh>我们要确保能再次找到工作簿，所以需要检查单元格地址和保存位置。</c>

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:06.455
<c.caption-en>You'll use three tools today. Our lesson web app will guide you through the activities.</c>
<c.caption-zh>今天会用到三种工具。课程网页会一步步引导你完成活动。</c>

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:12.345
<c.caption-en>Microsoft Excel is where you make changes to your celebration plan. Your school OneDrive is where you keep your workbook.</c>
<c.caption-zh>你在 Microsoft Excel 中修改庆祝活动计划，并将工作簿保存在学校 OneDrive 中。</c>

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:15.115
<c.caption-en>Let me show you where to begin.</c>
<c.caption-zh>我来演示从哪里开始。</c>

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:24.765
<c.caption-en>Open Microsoft Teams and find Y7T Computer Science 2026-2027. Select Classwork.</c>
<c.caption-zh>打开 Microsoft Teams，找到 Y7T Computer Science 2026-2027，然后选择 Classwork。</c>

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:31.135
<c.caption-en>Look for Week 9 Practical – Eco-Budget – Getting Started with Excel. Open that module</c>
<c.caption-zh>找到 Week 9 Practical – Eco-Budget – Getting Started with Excel，打开这个模块，</c>

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:35.555
<c.caption-en>and select the first link: Start Here – Eco-Budget web app.</c>
<c.caption-zh>选择第一个链接：Start Here – Eco-Budget web app。</c>

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:41.635
<c.caption-en>You can see the heading Plan a class celebration. Enter your name and class.</c>
<c.caption-zh>你会看到标题 Plan a class celebration。输入你的姓名和班级。</c>

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:47.695
<c.caption-en>At the top, choose English or English plus Mandarin if you need the language support.</c>
<c.caption-zh>如果需要语言支持，在上方选择 English 或 English + 中文。</c>

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:50.335
<c.caption-en>Use it if it helps you understand the instructions.</c>
<c.caption-zh>如果它能帮助你理解说明，就使用它。</c>

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:56.405
<c.caption-en>Choose your device. If you're using an iPad, select iPad · Excel app.</c>
<c.caption-zh>选择你的设备。如果用 iPad，就选择 iPad · Excel app。</c>

00:02:56.420 --> 00:03:02.965
<c.caption-en>That choice helps the web page show you the right instructions. Now select Start / resume my lesson.</c>
<c.caption-zh>这样网页就会显示合适的设备说明。然后选择 Start / resume my lesson。</c>

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:09.195
<c.caption-en>You'll begin with a card called Your class. Your celebration. For now, stay in the lesson web page.</c>
<c.caption-zh>首先会看到 Your class. Your celebration. 学习卡。现在先留在课程网页。</c>

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.885
<c.caption-en>I'll guide you into Excel when we reach Main task 2.</c>
<c.caption-zh>到了 Main task 2，我会引导你进入 Excel。</c>

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:19.365
<c.caption-en>Read one card, try the activity and check the feedback before you continue.</c>
<c.caption-zh>每次读一张卡，完成活动，查看反馈，再继续。</c>

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:25.395
<c.caption-en>If I say Pause and look, stop typing or tapping and look towards me. Leave your work open.</c>
<c.caption-zh>如果我说 Pause and look，就停止打字或点击，看向老师。保持作业打开。</c>

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:32.360
<c.caption-en>Remember, you don't need to rush. I want you to understand what you're changing and check it carefully. Let's get started.</c>
<c.caption-zh>记住，不用着急。要理解自己在改什么，并仔细检查。我们开始吧。</c>
